{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00220","headline":"唐享昊天乐 第四 · 则天皇后","name":"唐享昊天乐 第四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巍巍叡业广，赫赫圣基隆。\n菲德承先顾，祯符萃眇躬。\n铭开武岩侧，图荐洛川中。\n微诚讵幽感，景命忽昭融。\n有怀慙紫极，无以谢玄穹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"则天皇后","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00220.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00220","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}